        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 2,
          "name": "Move Deleter",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "npc_spawn",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 32,
          "x": 192,
          "y": 224,
          "properties": [
            {
              "name": "npcId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "move_deleter"
            },
            {
              "name": "sprite",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "youngster"
            },
            {
              "name": "trainer",
              "type": "bool",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "name": "originalId",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Uh...Oh, yes, I'm the Move Deleter.\nI can make Pok\u00e9mon forget their moves.\nWould you like me to do that?\nWhich Pok\u00e9mon should forget a move?\nCome again if there are moves that need to be\nforgotten.\nWhat? No Egg should know any moves.\nWhat? I can't make a Shadow Pok\u00e9mon forget a\nmove.\nseems to know only one move...\nWhich move should be forgotten?\nHm! 's ? That move should be forgotten?\nIt worked to perfection!\nhas forgotten  completely.\nCome again if there are moves that need to be\nforgotten.\nCome again if there are moves that need to be\nforgotten."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 3,
          "name": "Move Relearner",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "npc_spawn",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 32,
          "x": 160,
          "y": 224,
          "properties": [
            {
              "name": "npcId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "move_relearner"
            },
            {
              "name": "sprite",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "guide"
            },
            {
              "name": "trainer",
              "type": "bool",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "name": "originalId",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 3
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "I'm the Pok\u00e9mon Move Maniac.\nI know every single move that Pok\u00e9mon learn\ngrowing up.\nI'm also a collector of Heart Scales.\nIf you bring me one, I'll teach a move to one of your\nPok\u00e9mon.\nOh! That's it! That's an honest to goodness Heart\nScale!\nLet me guess, you want me to teach one of your\nPok\u00e9mon a move?\nWhich Pok\u00e9mon needs tutoring?\nIf your Pok\u00e9mon need to learn a move, come back\nwith a Heart Scale.\nHunh? There isn't a single move that I can teach an\nEgg.\nNo way, I don't want to go near a Shadow\nPok\u00e9mon.\nSorry...\nIt doesn't appear as if I have any move I can teach\nto your .\nWhich move should I teach to your ?\nN handed over one Heart Scale in exchange.\nIf your Pok\u00e9mon need to learn a move, come back\nwith a Heart Scale.\nIf your Pok\u00e9mon need to learn a move, come back\nwith a Heart Scale.\nIf your Pok\u00e9mon need to learn a move, come back\nwith a Heart Scale.\nIf your Pok\u00e9mon need to learn a move, come back\nwith a Heart Scale."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 4,
          "name": "Name Rater",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "npc_spawn",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 32,
          "x": 320,
          "y": 224,
          "properties": [
            {
              "name": "npcId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "name_rater"
            },
            {
              "name": "sprite",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "namerater"
            },
            {
              "name": "trainer",
              "type": "bool",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "name": "originalId",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 4
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Hello, hello!I am the official Name Rater!\nWant me to rate the nicknames of your Pok\u00e9mon?\nWhich Pok\u00e9mon's nickname should I critique?\nI see.Do come visit again.\nNow, now... That is merely an Egg!\nI wouldn't dare critique a Shadow Pok\u00e9mon's name!\nHmmm...  it is!\nThis is a magnificent nickname! It is impeccably\nbeyond reproach!\nYou'll do well to cherish your  now and\nbeyond.\n, is it?That is a decent nickname!\nBut, would you like me to give it a nicer name?\nHow about it?\nAh, good. Then, what shall the new nickname be?\nI see. You're right, there's no need to change this\nPok\u00e9mon's nickname.\nIt already had a superb name!\nDone! From now on, this Pok\u00e9mon shall be known\nas !\nIt looks no different from before, and yet, this is\nvastly superior!\nHow fortunate for you!\nDone! From now on, this Pok\u00e9mon shall be known\nas !\nIt is a better name than before!How fortunate for\nyou!\nI see.Do come visit again.\nI see.Do come visit again."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 5,
