              "value": 5
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Hello! I'm a Move Tutor!\nI can teach a special and powerful move to your\nPok\u00e9mon.\nWhich special move would you like me to teach?\nWould you like me to teach another Pok\u00e9mon a\nspecial move?\nWould you like me to teach another Pok\u00e9mon a\nspecial move?\nWould you like me to teach another Pok\u00e9mon a\nspecial move?\nCome back any time!"
            }
          ]
        }
